# 31337 is the in memory chain the deploy test runs on, so its record is an
# artifact of running the suite rather than something that exists anywhere.
# Real deploys are committed, because the addresses are the record of what is on
# chain and anybody checking our claims starts from them.
31337.json

# The fork demo keeps mainnet's chain id so the production scripts run unchanged,
# and it removes its own 4663.json on the way out. What it leaves behind is this
# one file, which the screens read and which lives as long as the anvil does.
# tools/fork-demo.sh
demo.json
demo-hasher.txt
